{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "erd",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Calin data model: multi-repo sessions",
    "locale": "en",
    "output": "calin/docs/specs/diagrams/calin-data-model.html",
    "quality_profile": "standard",
    "views": [
      { "id": "repo-set", "label": "A session's repo set", "focus": ["session", "session_repo", "repo", "pull_request"], "note": "session_repo is the join: one row, one worktree and at most one PR per attached repo." },
      { "id": "graph", "label": "What the graph is drawn from", "focus": ["agent", "message", "event"], "note": "Agents are nodes; parent links and messages are the edges; events order them in time." },
      { "id": "attribution", "label": "Who changed what, where", "focus": ["file_change", "event", "session_repo", "agent"], "note": "Each file change points at the event that made it and the repo it landed in." }
    ]
  },
  "layout": { "mode": "grid", "gapX": 76, "gapY": 40 },
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "workspace", "label": "workspace", "tag": "workspace", "row": 0, "col": 0,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "name", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "scan_roots", "type": "TEXT json" },
        { "name": "max_parallel", "type": "INTEGER" },
        { "name": "created_at", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "repo", "label": "repo", "tag": "workspace", "row": 1, "col": 0,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "workspace_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "workspace.id" },
        { "name": "name", "type": "TEXT", "key": "uk" },
        { "name": "role", "type": "TEXT home|code" },
        { "name": "remote_url", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "local_path", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "default_branch", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "checks", "type": "TEXT json" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "session", "label": "session", "tag": "session", "row": 0, "col": 1,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "workspace_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "workspace.id" },
        { "name": "parent_session_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "session.id" },
        { "name": "root_session_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "session.id" },
        { "name": "title", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "prompt", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "status", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "branch", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "workflow", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "ticket_ref", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "budget_usd", "type": "REAL" },
        { "name": "created_at", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "session_repo", "label": "session_repo", "tag": "session", "row": 1, "col": 1,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "session_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "session.id" },
        { "name": "repo_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "repo.id" },
        { "name": "mode", "type": "TEXT write|read|live" },
        { "name": "worktree_path", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "base_ref", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "head_sha", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "attached_by", "type": "TEXT user|agent" },
        { "name": "attached_at", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pull_request", "label": "pull_request", "tag": "session", "row": 2, "col": 1,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "session_repo_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "session_repo.id" },
        { "name": "number", "type": "INTEGER" },
        { "name": "url", "type": "TEXT", "key": "uk" },
        { "name": "state", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "ci_state", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "review_state", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "updated_at", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "event", "label": "event", "tag": "event log", "row": 0, "col": 2,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT ulid", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "session_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "session.id" },
        { "name": "agent_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "agent.id" },
        { "name": "parent_event_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "event.id" },
        { "name": "seq", "type": "INTEGER" },
        { "name": "kind", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "item_id", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "log_offset", "type": "INTEGER" },
        { "name": "ts", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "file_change", "label": "file_change", "tag": "event log", "row": 1, "col": 2,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "event_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "event.id" },
        { "name": "session_repo_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "session_repo.id" },
        { "name": "path", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "op", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "added", "type": "INTEGER" },
        { "name": "removed", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "agent", "label": "agent", "tag": "agents", "row": 0, "col": 3,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "session_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "session.id" },
        { "name": "parent_agent_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "agent.id" },
        { "name": "kind", "type": "TEXT process|subagent" },
        { "name": "role", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "runner", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "model", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "native_session_id", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "status", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "cost_usd", "type": "REAL" },
        { "name": "tokens_in", "type": "INTEGER" },
        { "name": "tokens_out", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "message", "label": "message", "tag": "agents", "row": 1, "col": 3,
      "attributes": [
        { "name": "id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "pk" },
        { "name": "from_agent_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "agent.id" },
        { "name": "to_agent_id", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "agent.id" },
        { "name": "in_reply_to", "type": "TEXT", "key": "fk", "references": "message.id" },
        { "name": "kind", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "body", "type": "TEXT" },
        { "name": "created_at", "type": "INTEGER" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "relationships": [
    { "id": "repo_workspace", "from": "repo", "to": "workspace", "fromCardinality": "many", "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "session_workspace", "from": "session", "to": "workspace", "fromCardinality": "many", "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "session_repo_session", "from": "session_repo", "to": "session", "label": "repo set", "fromCardinality": "many", "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "session_repo_repo", "from": "session_repo", "to": "repo", "fromCardinality": "many", "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "pr_session_repo", "from": "pull_request", "to": "session_repo", "fromCardinality": "many", "fromOptional": true, "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "event_session", "from": "event", "to": "session", "fromCardinality": "many", "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "event_agent", "from": "event", "to": "agent", "label": "emitted by", "fromCardinality": "many", "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "file_change_event", "from": "file_change", "to": "event", "fromCardinality": "many", "fromOptional": true, "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "file_change_session_repo", "from": "file_change", "to": "session_repo", "label": "lands in", "fromCardinality": "many", "fromOptional": true, "toCardinality": "one" },
    { "id": "message_agent", "from": "message", "to": "agent", "label": "from / to", "fromCardinality": "many", "fromOptional": true, "toCardinality": "one" }
  ],
  "cards": [
    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Multi-repo", "items": [
      "A session never belongs to one repo. Its repo set is the session_repo rows, and the home repo is one of them.",
      "branch is stored once on the session and used in every attached repo.",
      "mode: write is a worktree, read is the main checkout without edits, live edits the main checkout in place.",
      "A child session points at its parent and its root, so changes and cost roll up over the whole tree."
    ] },
    { "dot": "violet", "title": "Graph", "items": [
      "agent.parent_agent_id records who spawned whom, for separate processes and for an agent's own subagents.",
      "A message with a null from or to agent is from or to you.",
      "event.parent_event_id is causality: the tool call that produced a spawn, the message that woke an agent."
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Reading this schema", "items": [
      "This is the SQLite index. Event bodies live in the per-session NDJSON log; log_offset points into it.",
      "seq is unique per session and is what clients replay from.",
      "Self-references (session tree, agent tree, event parent, reply chain) and the agent's session are shown as columns, not lines.",
      "repo.local_path is per machine; name and remote_url come from the home repo's repo list."
    ] }
  ]
}
